END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mitra Evening with Padmavajra
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260714T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260714T213000
UID:81b2b9e76e2f5e483d101981@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:A special evening for Mitras with Padmavajra. Inspired by the 
 Tantric path\, he'll give a talk\, lead a Q&A\, and guide us through a spe
 cial meditation practice drawing on one of Buddhism's most ancient symbols
  of the enlightened mind. All Mitras welcome – join us from 6pm in the M
 andala Café for supper.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mitra-evening-with-padma
 vajra
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Daytime Buddhism & Meditation Class
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260715T103500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260715T123000
UID:0d7b3815765cc59c0f3b3859@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:In this series\, we will be exploring the essential teachings 
 of Buddhism. We will do this by way of talks\, discussion and workshops lo
 oking at the Three Jewels – Buddha\, Dharma\, Sangha – and seeing how 
 these can guide us in our lives today.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/daytime-buddhism-15-jul
END:VEVENT
